  "anchor": "Plan v29 Phase 2 — Industry Cost Profile (ICP). Per-SECTOR cost-line shares + flex parameters, used by the cost-structure engine to decompose every (industry, country) into a defensible waterfall. Cost shares are global-baseline (US/EU-anchored, internal-only); the modifier matrix flexes each line by country profile. Universal terms only (R-002).",
